and UAPI 6 symbol lookup + modules.rc path support (3b607917d2537efcd89c43004d4d8bbd8fb84d95).
Base: 7fbbb1f12e2410b69c8ebf958be84f165b8d0c93.
The optional preinit runner is disabled, as permitted by upstream KSU_NO_PREINIT;
KSU_GET_INFO_FLAG_PREINIT is never advertised. Keep the tested SUSFS hook ABI.
Sources: https://github.com/SukiSU-Ultra/SukiSU-Ultra/commit/7ef2dbb7fa68722c142f5266f0a7b95c8fb6e7e9
